SUMMARY:FirstCheck: Investor Foundations (Online)
DTSTAMP:20260806T111135Z
DTSTART:20260811T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://luma.com/v74i7n5l \n​Before you invest i
	n anything\, you need to understand how smart angel investing actually wor
	ks. Not the mythology\, the mechanics. This course gives you that foundati
	on. ​Participants gain clarity on: \n​How early-stage investing functions 
	​\nThe role investors play in innovation and wealth creation\n​Whether thi
	s asset class aligns with their long-term goals\n​The simple methodology t
	hat creates a more intentional entry point into investing ​ \nYou’ll leave
	 this class with a clear picture of how capital flows\, how returns are ge
	nerated\, and whether this asset class belongs in your long-term strategy.
	\n\nhttps://iondistrict.com/event/firstcheck-investor-foundations-online/\
	n\nFrom Ion District
